{"id":"vod_sn_36560","vodId":"36560","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"恋爱选举与巧克力","name_cn":"恋爱选举与巧克力","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/de00cd26f9c877b96fe325f31097802a.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在私立高藤学园的校园中，这一年，童年好友大岛祐树（中村悠一 配音）和住吉千里（中村绘里子 配音）共同升上了二年级。作为在校学生，课后的社团活动是校园生活必不可少的一部分，祐树和千里伙同同学木场冬美（水桥香织 配音）一同组织了“食品研究部”。说是研究部，其实不过就 是大家在一起分享美味的零食，但这简单的活动带给了女孩子们无比美好的课后时光。　　不幸的是，研究部最大的敌人东云皐月（浅川悠 配音）发出了“解散没有实际成绩的社团”的宣言，而他本人很可能即将当选学生自治会的会长。为了保护心爱的社团，女孩子们决定以竞争对手的身份加入竞选，一场轰轰烈烈的社团保护战开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cWmFfELi4r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sN6PDpauFM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KtaaNT8Ewv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v491S4cdK01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jf42wNgLJv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QzRnxTTMhJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cK83iyAwWr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7QBrcgV6jk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w9nZpdEZnQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dLkz8E22cF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tQvZhdfZgv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ExaNLjbvBW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8DH0fFuM1c1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.177Z"}